html:
{%- macro v(value) -%}{{ (value or "") | e }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro day(value) -%}{{ frappe.utils.format_date(value) if value else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro who(user) -%}{{ v(frappe.db.get_value("User", user, "full_name") if user else "") }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro num(value) -%}{{ "{:.1f}".format(value | float) if value is not none else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
<style>
.lpl-form { font-family: Cambria, Georgia, serif; font-size: 11.5px; color: #000; line-height: 1.45; }
.lpl-form p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
.lpl-form table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.lpl-form th, .lpl-form td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 4px 6px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left; }
.lpl-form th { background: #f2f2f2; font-weight: bold; }
.lpl-form .ref td { font-size: 10.5px; }
.lpl-form h3 { font-size: 12.5px; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 8px 0 12px; }
.lpl-form h4 { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: bold; margin: 12px 0 6px; }
.lpl-form .rule { min-height: 34px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
.lpl-form .sign { border: none; padding: 6px 0 0; }
.lpl-form .narrow { width: 9%; text-align: center; }
.lpl-form .scores td { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; }
</style>
<div class="lpl-form">
{%- set ref = "LPL/HR/18" %}{% set issued = "01-03-2017" %}{% set revised = "01-11-2024" %}{% set revision = "01" %}
{% set title = "Supervisory skills Evaluation Form" %}
<table class="ref"><tr>
<td rowspan="2" style="width:34%"><b>LUUKA PLASTICS LIMITED</b></td>
<td>Doc Ref. No: {{ ref }}</td><td>Initial Issue Date {{ issued }}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Revision Date: {{ revised }}</td><td>Revision No. {{ revision }}</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center"><b>{{ title }}</b></td></tr></table>

{%- set employee = frappe.get_doc("Employee", doc.employee) -%}
<table>
<tr><th style="width:16%">Name</th><td>{{ v(doc.employee_name) }}</td>
<th style="width:14%">Job Title</th><td>{{ v(doc.designation) }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Date of joining</th><td>{{ day(employee.date_of_joining) }}</td>
<th>Supervisor</th><td>{{ v(frappe.db.get_value("Employee", doc.custom_supervisor, "employee_name")
  if doc.custom_supervisor else "") }}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Section</th><td>{{ v(doc.department) }}</td>
<th>Year of Evaluation</th><td>{{ v(doc.custom_quarter) }} {{ v(doc.start_date.year if doc.start_date else "") }}</td></tr>
</table>

<p><b>Objectives.</b> The purpose of this exercise is to measure the supervisor&rsquo;s performance and contribution
during the previous business period and to evaluate the supervisor&rsquo;s performance.</p>
<p><b>Guidelines.</b> The employee should first conduct the self-assessment and after that meet and discuss with the
supervisor on the final score with justifications/examples where required. The employee/supervisor should also set the
objectives for the next performance period. The employees/supervisor should write N/A (Not Applicable) on factors that
are not in line with the employee&rsquo;s nature/scope of work.</p>
<p><b>Rating Scale:</b> Excellent=5 (90-100%), Very Good=4 (75 to 89%), Good=3 (60 to 74%), Average=2 (50 to 59%),
Below average=1 (40% and below)</p>

<h4>Section A: Ratable Factors</h4>
<table>
<tr><th>Factor</th><th class="narrow">Employee's rating</th><th class="narrow">Supervisor's rating</th>
<th style="width:32%">Supervisor's Comment</th></tr>
{%- for row in doc.custom_factors %}
<tr><td>{{ v(row.item) }}</td><td class="narrow">{{ v(row.employee_rating) }}</td>
<td class="narrow">{{ v(row.supervisor_rating) }}</td><td>{{ v(row.supervisor_comment) }}</td></tr>
{%- endfor %}
</table>

<h4>Section B: Performance objectives / Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) during previous evaluation period</h4>
<p>Objectives / KPIs should be in-line with the departmental / section objectives / KPIs.</p>
<table>
<tr><th style="width:5%">No.</th><th>Objectives / KPIs for previous evaluation period</th>
<th class="narrow">Employee's rating</th><th class="narrow">Supervisor's rating</th>
<th style="width:28%">Comments by the Supervisor</th></tr>
{%- for row in doc.custom_objectives %}
<tr><td>{{ loop.index }}</td><td>{{ v(row.item) }}</td><td class="narrow">{{ v(row.employee_rating) }}</td>
<td class="narrow">{{ v(row.supervisor_rating) }}</td><td>{{ v(row.supervisor_comment) }}</td></tr>
{%- endfor %}
</table>

<h4>Section C: Overall Scores / Rating</h4>
<p>Overall rating; Excellent=90-100%, Very Good=75-89%, Good=60-74%, Average=50-59%, Below Average=49% and below</p>
<table class="scores">
<tr><th>Total Rating</th><th>Ratable Factors /60</th><th>Objectives/KPIs /40</th><th>Total Score %</th>
<th>Overall Rating</th></tr>
<tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>{{ num(doc.custom_factors_score) }}</td><td>{{ num(doc.custom_objectives_score) }}</td>
<td>{{ num(doc.custom_total_score) }}</td><td>{{ v(doc.custom_band) }}</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>General</h4>
<p>1. List down the roles and responsibilities of your position in the company</p>
<div class="rule">{{ v(doc.custom_roles) }}</div>
<p>2. What are the skills you possess as a supervisor?</p>
<div class="rule">{{ v(doc.custom_skills) }}</div>
<p>3. Can you share any achievements from the time you were appointed a supervisor?</p>
<div class="rule">{{ v(doc.custom_achievements) }}</div>
<p>4. Can you share any challenges faced?</p>
<div class="rule">{{ v(doc.custom_challenges) }}</div>

{%- macro block(title, remarks, by, on) -%}
<p><b>{{ title }}</b></p>
<div class="rule">{{ v(remarks) }}</div>
<p>Sign {{ who(by) }} &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip; Date {{ day(on) }} &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>
{%- endmacro -%}
{{ block("General comments by the Employee:", doc.custom_employee_remarks, doc.custom_employee_signed_by,
          doc.custom_employee_signed_on) }}
{{ block("General comments by the Supervisor of the Employee:", doc.custom_supervisor_remarks,
          doc.custom_supervisor_by, doc.custom_supervisor_on) }}
{{ block("Human Resources Manager's remarks:", doc.custom_hrm_remarks, doc.custom_hrm_by, doc.custom_hrm_on) }}
{{ block("Production Manager's remarks:", doc.custom_production_remarks, doc.custom_production_by,
          doc.custom_production_on) }}
{{ block("General Manager's remarks:", doc.custom_gm_remarks, doc.custom_gm_by, doc.custom_gm_on) }}
</div>
